    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Convicted of the highest crimes against the <strong>United Federation</strong>, you are sentenced to <strong>Void Harvest</strong> - a life of labor in the endless abyss of space. With nothing but a barely functional ship and the will to survive, you must <strong>mine asteroids, scavenge derelicts, refine resources, </strong>and<strong> upgrade </strong>your vessel to withstand the merciless void. Every scrap of ore you extract serves the Federation, but the real question remains - can you outlast the sentence, or will the void claim you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c <strong>Explore the Unknown:</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397460/extras/e6bb5651c675431c9c19cd001ca579ff.poster.avif?t=1749058321\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397460/extras/e6bb5651c675431c9c19cd001ca579ff.webm?t=1749058321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397460/extras/e6bb5651c675431c9c19cd001ca579ff.mp4?t=1749058321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through breathtaking systems, uncover hidden anomalies, and unlock the secrets of the universe. From luminous nebulae to desolate asteroid belts, every corner of space holds wonders - and perils.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26cf\ufe0f <strong>Mine Asteroids, Harvest Riches:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397460/extras/e4d88e4ebdb3eb85f2845225830e65f8.poster.avif?t=1749058321\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397460/extras/e4d88e4ebdb3eb85f2845225830e65f8.webm?t=1749058321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397460/extras/e4d88e4ebdb3eb85f2845225830e65f8.mp4?t=1749058321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn cosmic rubble into valuable resources. Utilize advanced mining tools and techniques to extract rare ores, but beware - each asteroid could conceal hidden dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd27 <strong>Craft and Customize:</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397460/extras/e007e98069da12bc529051bc0265222a.poster.avif?t=1749058321\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397460/extras/e007e98069da12bc529051bc0265222a.webm?t=1749058321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397460/extras/e007e98069da12bc529051bc0265222a.mp4?t=1749058321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your mined resources to craft cutting-edge modules and upgrades. Unlock blueprints, enhance your ship, and build the perfect vessel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0f <strong>Upgrade and Evolve:</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397460/extras/3b8d3856f673693ba7d7d95753ff5ce0.poster.avif?t=1749058321\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397460/extras/3b8d3856f673693ba7d7d95753ff5ce0.webm?t=1749058321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397460/extras/3b8d3856f673693ba7d7d95753ff5ce0.mp4?t=1749058321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your ship from a humble mining vessel into a legendary spacecraft capable of taking on the toughest challenges. Experiment with different loadouts and strategies to overcome environmental hazards, limited resources, and hostile encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Survive and Thrive:</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397460/extras/8be6ea3ac1377d3bd8f9e5f92e8e3692.poster.avif?t=1749058321\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397460/extras/8be6ea3ac1377d3bd8f9e5f92e8e3692.webm?t=1749058321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397460/extras/8be6ea3ac1377d3bd8f9e5f92e8e3692.mp4?t=1749058321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fuel is scarce, cargo holds are limited, and hazards abound. Only the smartest and most resourceful pilots will turn a humble mining ship into a galactic legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Assemble Your Crew:</strong> <br>Recruit skilled crew members to aid you on your journey. Each brings unique abilities, from expert mining skills to advanced ship management, giving you an edge in the vastness of space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8e <strong>Dynamic Gameplay:</strong> <br>No two playthroughs are the same. Procedurally generated star systems ensure every expedition feels fresh, while a variety of events keep you on your toes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Federation has sentenced you - now it's time to fight for survival, harvest the depths of space, and prove you\u2019re more than just a convict in <strong>Void Harvest</strong>!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Convicted of the highest crimes against the <strong>United Federation</strong>, you are sentenced to <strong>Void Harvest</strong> - a life of labor in the endless abyss of space. With nothing but a barely functional ship and the will to survive, you must <strong>mine asteroids, scavenge derelicts, refine resources, </strong>and<strong> upgrade </strong>your vessel to withstand the merciless void. Every scrap of ore you extract serves the Federation, but the real question remains - can you outlast the sentence, or will the void claim you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c <strong>Explore the Unknown:</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397460/extras/e6bb5651c675431c9c19cd001ca579ff.poster.avif?t=1749058321\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397460/extras/e6bb5651c675431c9c19cd001ca579ff.webm?t=1749058321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397460/extras/e6bb5651c675431c9c19cd001ca579ff.mp4?t=1749058321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through breathtaking systems, uncover hidden anomalies, and unlock the secrets of the universe. From luminous nebulae to desolate asteroid belts, every corner of space holds wonders - and perils.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26cf\ufe0f <strong>Mine Asteroids, Harvest Riches:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397460/extras/e4d88e4ebdb3eb85f2845225830e65f8.poster.avif?t=1749058321\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shar